{"body": {"collection": "abu-dawud", "grade": "unknown", "narrator": null, "number": 2837, "text_en": "the Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) directed that the child be named, have its hair shaved, and a sacrifice be offered on the seventh day after birth"}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "the-master-and-the-disciple", "chapter": "ch12a-rebirth-and-the-seven-day-tawaf", "date": "2026-06-14"}, "id": "hadith:abu-dawud:2837", "sources": [{"book": "the-master-and-the-disciple", "chapter": "ch12a-rebirth-and-the-seven-day-tawaf", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "hadith", "variants": []}
{"body": {"collection": "abu-dawud", "grade": "sahih", "narrator": null, "number": 3641, "text_en": "Verily, the scholars are the heirs of the prophets. The prophets do not bequeath dinars or dirhams; they bequeath knowledge. So whoever takes hold of it has taken an abundant share."}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "kitab-al-riyad", "chapter": "ch13-prophets-as-teachers-monotheism-and-the-ranks", "date": "2026-06-14"}, "id": "hadith:abu-dawud:3641", "sources": [{"book": "kitab-al-riyad", "chapter": "ch13-prophets-as-teachers-monotheism-and-the-ranks", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "hadith", "variants": []}
{"body": {"collection": "bukhari", "grade": "unknown", "narrator": null, "number": 1, "text_en": "Actions are only by intentions, and every person shall have only what he intended. So whoever's migration was for Allah and His Messenger, his migration was for Allah and His Messenger; and whoever's migration was for some worldly gain or a woman he would marry, his migration was for what he migrated to."}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "the-master-and-the-disciple", "chapter": "ch03c-five-conditions-and-the-covenant", "date": "2026-06-14"}, "id": "hadith:bukhari:1", "sources": [{"book": "the-master-and-the-disciple", "chapter": "ch03c-five-conditions-and-the-covenant", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "hadith", "variants": []}
{"body": {"collection": "muslim", "grade": "sahih", "narrator": null, "number": 2408, "text_en": "I am leaving among you two weighty things, the Book of Allah and my Family; they will never separate until they reach me at the pool."}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "the-master-and-the-disciple", "chapter": "ch16e-jewels-moon-and-the-description-of-religion", "date": "2026-06-14"}, "id": "hadith:muslim:2408", "sources": [{"book": "the-master-and-the-disciple", "chapter": "ch16e-jewels-moon-and-the-description-of-religion", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "hadith", "variants": []}
{"body": {"collection": "other", "grade": "unknown", "narrator": "Prophet Muhammad", "number": 0, "text_en": "Whoever Allah wishes good for, He grants him understanding of the religion."}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "the-master-and-the-disciple", "chapter": "ch02b-the-test-of-speech-and-the-design-of-creation", "date": "2026-06-14"}, "id": "hadith:other:1d11153b9dd6", "sources": [{"book": "the-master-and-the-disciple", "chapter": "ch02b-the-test-of-speech-and-the-design-of-creation", "locator": null}, {"book": "the-master-and-the-disciple", "chapter": "ch07d-air-and-the-instance-beyond-air", "locator": null}, {"book": "the-master-and-the-disciple", "chapter": "ch16e-jewels-moon-and-the-description-of-religion", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "hadith", "variants": [{"book": "the-master-and-the-disciple", "text_en": "I was a hidden treasure and I loved to be known, so I created creation in order to be known.", "translator": null}]}
{"body": {"collection": "other", "grade": "unknown", "narrator": "Imam Ali", "number": 147, "text_en": "Hearts are vessels; the best of them is the most retentive."}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "kitab-al-riyad", "chapter": "ch02-soul-intellect-and-the-power-of-emanation", "date": "2026-06-14"}, "id": "hadith:other:3e139d19f13c", "sources": [{"book": "kitab-al-riyad", "chapter": "ch02-soul-intellect-and-the-power-of-emanation", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "hadith", "variants": []}
{"body": {"collection": "other", "grade": "unknown", "narrator": "the Prophet", "number": 1763, "text_en": "there will come upon people a time when nothing remains of Islam except its name and nothing remains of the Quran except its script; their mosques will be full of buildings but empty of guidance; their learned ones will be the worst people under the sky — from them strife will go out and to them it will return"}, "confidence": 1.0, "content_level": null, "first_seen": {"book": "the-master-and-the-disciple", "chapter": "ch19c-the-conspiracy-formula", "date": "2026-06-14"}, "id": "hadith:other:8855ade67efb", "sources": [{"book": "the-master-and-the-disciple", "chapter": "ch19c-the-conspiracy-formula", "locator": null}], "tradition": "universal", "type": "hadith", "variants": []}
